OL,3,GNEWSAUnion calls for new uni leadership
OL,4,Aafter boss sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade union members at the University
OL,7,Fof Greater Manchester have staged a
OL,8,Fprotest demanding "greater
OL,9,Ftransparency" following the sacking of
OL,10,Fthe former vice chancellor professor
OL,11,FGeorge Holmes.
OL,13,FUnison members at the institution in
OL,14,FBolton said the current board of
OL,15,Fgovernors should step aside, arguing
OL,16,Fthe university can only move on with a
OL,17,F"clean slate".
OL,19,FHolmes was suspended after the
OL,20,Funiversity commissioned an independent
OL,21,Finquiry into allegations of financial
OL,22,Fmismanagement and other misconduct.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
